       The security questionnaire from your customer or insurer, answered honestly: a dated self-declaration, an action plan with dates, an emergency card, an evidence list, a cover letter with questionnaire mapping and a clause checklist. Forty-seven questions, 40 of them required, the example business prefilled; one dated document set. With a handbook of thirty-seven pages that names the source behind every question. 
