   How it works 
   PDF DOCX XLSX ZIP 1 Answer Thirty-four or forty-seven questions, the example business prefilled. Stop and come back any time. PDF DOCX XLSX ZIP 2 Download Seven dated documents as PDF, DOCX and XLSX, all as one ZIP. 3 Enact Sign, post, brief, send; freeze a version in your evidence folder. Updates during the licence. 1 2 3 



     Listed, not hidden. Sourced, dated, ready to show 
     Fact Read at the original source, with retrieval date. Interpretation Our conclusion, open to argument. Uncertain Sources contradict each other or the law is open. Gap No source answers it, so you decide and the field stays open on purpose. 
     Every rule in the documents has a reason in the handbook, and every reason has a source with its retrieval date. What is not settled is marked, not hidden: every uncertainty is listed with its status, seventeen points in the AI Policy Toolkit, of which eight remain open, and twenty-three in the Security Evidence Toolkit, of which thirteen remain open, as of 23 October 2026. Read the handbooks before you buy, or download the documents of the fictional example business. 
