       The check finds patterns: names after a salutation or a label such as "Customer:", street names, common identifiers and a list of health and access words. Health words covered: krank…, Arzt…, Ärzt…, Therap…, Befund…, Diagnos…, Operation…, Behinderung, Schwerbehind…, Reha…, Kur, Krebs, Covid, Corona, AU-Bescheinigung, arbeitsunfähig…, Bandscheib…, Burnout, Depression, Allergie, Medikament, schwanger; sick, ill, illness, cancer, diabetes, diagnosis, therapy, medication, disability, pregnant, allergy, surgery, hospital. "Befund", "Operation" and "behindert" without another health word count only as possible. Access words covered: password, Passwort, Kennwort, PIN, API key, secret, token, login, WLAN, WiFi, Schlüssel, pw, Zugang, Zugangsdaten, Zugangscode, followed by ":", "=", "is", "ist", "lautet", "heißt", by "für …" with one of these, or a value with a digit. A name without salutation, a nickname, a rare job title or an address without a house number can stay unmarked. Treat green as "nothing obvious". 


